---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={"Task Satiation vs. Aggregate Rebound in AI Demand"}
  description={"About: Task Satiation vs. Aggregate Rebound in AI Demand. Once a task is done, more machine effort on that task adds nothing."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Economics paper · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Task Satiation vs. Aggregate Rebound in AI Demand
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      In this paper, AI means artificial intelligence: software that performs tasks such as writing, coding or answering questions. Once a task is done, more machine effort on that task adds nothing. This paper defines that stop precisely and separates it from the separate question of whether total demand for machine work keeps growing.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Every job has a finish line. After it, more computer work on that job is waste.</li>
        <li>Cheaper computer work can still make people start many more jobs, so total use can keep rising.</li>
        <li>Money prices for AI are falling fast, but the electricity it uses is never free.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/satiation/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/satiation/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/satiation.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
